<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/RelationshipType/hasDeclaredLicense> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The `from` Artifact was discovered to actually contain each `to` AnyLicenseInfo (for example, as detected by automated tooling)."@en .
